// alternate source: http://geoelections.free.fr/France/histoire/1932L_elus.htm
// proportions differ for different sources! Party affiliation was unclear in many cases!
// let's just use frwiki (no "other")
// election results in 1936 (official): https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k320440p/
// SFIO: 129/605 according to enwiki, 132/607 according to frwiki
